# Python / FastAPI

When changing Python in this repo:

- Keep the existing layout: routes → workflows/services → repositories → Supabase.
- Reuse existing repositories, services, and Pydantic models. Do not introduce a parallel stack.
- Runtime LLM calls go through existing `OllamaService` / `config.py` env vars. Do not hardcode model names.
- After implementation, run the smallest relevant tests or checks. There may be no test suite yet; do not invent a framework unless the approved plan says to.
